Clutter for Sunrise (version 0.3.0)

A port of Clutter 0.6.2 by EmilSG.
Original source: https://github.com/EmilsGithub/Clutter-Mod-Repository
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Minecraft 26.3 by lavoide, and to Sunrise by arismoko: the blocks' behaviour is re-implemented
in Rust on Sunrise's mod API (no Java code is included). The data in data/, the models, textures
and translations in assets/ and icon.png (built from the mod's own textures) are the original release's.
